    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Can you help me move into a retirement village?</summary><p>Yes. We help you sort, pack, move and settle into a retirement village, retirement apartment or bungalow anywhere in the UK, working to your move-in date.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I fit my belongings into a smaller home?</summary><p>We help you decide what fits, what to pass on and what to sell or donate, so you only move what will work in the new space.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can my family help from a distance?</summary><p>Yes. Family can be involved by phone or video, and your coordinator keeps everyone updated.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does a move to a retirement home cost?</summary><p>Packing and removals start at &pound;995 and full-service moves at &pound;1,850. A Discovery Consultation at &pound;150 gives you a personalised budget first.</p></details>
